{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miria.watanabe/img/miria.watanabe/img/2017/04/15/6223453/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんは、ナカダカナシカです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"嘘です、ワタナベミリアです。\n( 花奈さんごめんなさい )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ネタバレしちゃうの早すぎかって\n今自分で思っちゃいました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"改めまして、渡辺です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"先日は幕張にて握手会がありました！\n来て下さった皆様、ありがとうございます"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1.2部"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miria.watanabe/img/miria.watanabe/img/2017/04/15/6223453/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1部だけ限定で普段から使っています\nガチ眼鏡をかけてやっちゃいました〜\nコンタクトは疲れちゃいますものね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"3.4部"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miria.watanabe/img/miria.watanabe/img/2017/04/15/6223453/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ポーズが何とも言えず気持ち悪いですね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"というか久しぶりのツインテール\nやってしまいました、、\nしかも短いから尚幼く見える(._.)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miria.watanabe/img/miria.watanabe/img/2017/04/15/6223453/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お花も！ありがとうございました！！\n私の大好きなマイラーバルーンがたくさん\n嬉しき。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とりあえず隠れてみました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初めましての皆様\n毎回来て頂いている皆様\nお久しぶりの皆様"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"色々なお話しが出来て笑ったり、感動したり\nまた頑張ろう！と力を頂きました\n来て下さった皆様ありがとうございました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近、生駒さんと見間違えると\nいろいろなメンバーから言われます\n生駒さんも言われているみたいで。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"髪型や髪色、身長がだいたい同じだから\n双子や双子やと2人で言い合ってます(^-^)v\n生駒さん、ラブ(^-^)v"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生駒さん、ラブ(^-^)v"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"( なんで2回言ったかは突っ込まないでね )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miria.watanabe/img/miria.watanabe/img/2017/04/15/6223453/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ライブまであと5日と迫ってきました\n広い会場を12人だけで\n皆様と一体感をつくりだせるのか"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"時間がない"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆きてくれるかな"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"不安をあげたら切りがない"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"研究生時代に鍛えてきた精神力が\nあったはずなに情けないです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ライブまでの残された時間を\n皆様に楽しんでいただけるよう\n日々12人で頑張りますので宜しくお願いします"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"風船は生きている"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"またみてね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みり愛"}],"source":"archive"}